<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt allocates 766 Mln Sfrs in bond auction.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt allocates 766 Mln Sfrs in bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue terms were set on a reopened bond issue by the Swiss Treasury and the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - SWISS GOVERNMENT</p>
<p> AMT  = 766 MLN CHF  COUPON    = 4.50   MATURITY = 10.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE = FIXED-RATE   ISS PRICE = 103.45 SETTLEMENT = 13.JAN.97</p>
<p>YIELD TO MATURITY = 4.084 PCT</p>
<p>TOTAL BIDS = 997 MLN CHF</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE (PROVISIONAL) 551 861</p>
<p>FUNGIBLE WITH 470 458</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
